From: tas0dev <156896971+tas0dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 18:20:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] x86/mboot: bridge ViewKit scenes to the GPU renderer

Expose the shared display surface to a single privileged mDriver renderer and
synchronously forward validated scene submissions. The userspace renderer owns
Mesa and DRM policy; the hypervisor transport remains device independent.
---
 arch/x86/kernel/cpu/mboot.c | 189 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 189 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/x86/kernel/cpu/mboot.c
+++ b/arch/x86/kernel/cpu/mboot.c
@@ -16,6 +16,8 @@
